# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions for the latest version of Qiskit mitigation"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi untuk versi terbaru Qiskit mitigation"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Installation instructions {#installation-instructions}"
msgstr "Petunjuk instalasi {#installation-instructions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prerequisites {#prerequisites}"
msgstr "Prasyarat {#prerequisites}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, create a minimal environment with only Python installed in it. We recommend using [Python virtual environments](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"
msgstr "Pertama, buat environment minimal yang hanya berisi Python. Kami menyarankan memakai [virtual environment Python](https://docs.python.org/3/tutorial/venv.html).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Activate your new environment.\n"
msgstr "Aktifkan environment barumu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "There are two primary ways to install the packages:\n"
msgstr "Ada dua cara utama untuk menginstal paketnya:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 1: Install from PyPI](#option-1)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI](#option-1)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Option 2: Install from source](#option-2)\n"
msgstr "[Opsi 2: Instal dari sumber](#option-2)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-1\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 1: Install from PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"
msgstr "Opsi 1: Instal dari PyPI {#option-1-install-from-pypi}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The most straightforward way to install the `qiskit-mitigation` package is via `PyPI`.\n"
msgstr "Cara paling mudah untuk menginstal paket `qiskit-mitigation` adalah lewat `PyPI`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"option-2\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Option 2: Install from source {#option-2-install-from-source}"
msgstr "Opsi 2: Instal dari sumber {#option-2-install-from-source}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you plan to develop in the repository or run the notebooks locally, you should install from source.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu berencana mengembangkan di repositori ini atau menjalankan notebook secara lokal, sebaiknya instal dari sumber.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, clone the `qiskit-mitigation` repository.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, clone repositori `qiskit-mitigation`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, upgrade pip and enter the repository.\n"
msgstr "Selanjutnya, upgrade pip dan masuk ke repositori.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The next step is to install `qiskit-mitigation` to the virtual environment. If you plan to run the notebooks and their visualizations, install the notebook dependencies. If you plan on developing in the repository, install the `dev` dependencies.\n"
msgstr "Langkah berikutnya adalah menginstal `qiskit-mitigation` ke virtual environment. Jika kamu berencana menjalankan notebook beserta visualisasinya, instal dependensi notebook. Jika kamu berencana mengembangkan di repositori, instal dependensi `dev`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Adjust the options below to suit your needs.\n"
msgstr "Sesuaikan opsi di bawah dengan kebutuhanmu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If you installed the notebook dependencies, you can get started by running the notebooks in the `docs/` directory.\n"
msgstr "Jika kamu sudah menginstal dependensi notebook, kamu bisa mulai dengan menjalankan notebook di direktori `docs/`.\n"
